{"id":"c3a69f59b70a4436","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-halting-set-undecidable.md","title":"Diagonal Halting Set","display":"thm-halting-set-undecidable — Diagonal Halting Set","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-halting-set-undecidable","aliases":["68-thm-halting-set-undecidable"],"display":"thm-halting-set-undecidable — Diagonal Halting Set","depends_on":["[[68-df-halting-set]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]","[[68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem]]","[[68-thm-universal-function-theorem]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§14 diagonal set D, p.49 / PDF 58","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-halting-set-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-halting-set-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-halting-set-undecidable — Diagonal Halting Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8848af608d92d92b\" href=\"?note=8848af608d92d92b\" title=\"68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem\">68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e745949a6ee96af\" href=\"?note=9e745949a6ee96af\" title=\"68-thm-universal-function-theorem\">68-thm-universal-function-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§14 diagonal set D, p.49 / PDF 58"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 见所列上游。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar K:=\\mathbb N\\setminus K\">\\(\\bar K:=\\mathbb N\\setminus K\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\setminus\\mathrm{Recursive},\\qquad\\bar K\\notin\\mathrm{RE}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\setminus\\mathrm{Recursive},\\qquad\\bar K\\notin\\mathrm{RE}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §14 p.49 / PDF p.58 的对角集 D。通用求值的对角输入给出 K 为 RE。若补集为 W_d，则 d∈W_d 当且仅当 d∉K，当且仅当 d∉W_d，矛盾。若 K 递归，则补集也 RE，由此排除。该本地对角证明已核对；未把有限停机实验当作不可判定性的证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"8848af608d92d92b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-recursive-set-characterization-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-universal-function-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"9e745949a6ee96af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-universal-function-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]，$\\mathrm{RE}$、$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 与 $W_e$ 见所列上游。$\\bar K:=\\mathbb N\\setminus K$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar K:=\\mathbb N\\setminus K","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\setminus\\mathrm{Recursive},\\qquad\\bar K\\notin\\mathrm{RE}.","display":true}],"bytes":1222,"backlinks":[{"id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 §14 印刷 p.49 / PDF p.58 将同一对角 RE 集记作 D；本目录继续使用 K。K 的非递归性有独立定理 [[68-thm-halting-set-undecidable]]，不再只把它放在定义 Remark 中当作未经论证的结论。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-halting-set-undecidable]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-halting-set-undecidable|thm-halting-set-undecidable — Diagonal Halting Set]]"}],"outgoing":["eab12566d8ac44ad","7fc8baae87b873a3","8848af608d92d92b","9e745949a6ee96af"]}